# particle_manager.md.backup

This sanitized summary describes the Particle Manager in a generic form suitable for public backups.

## Responsibilities

- Spawn short-lived visual effects such as explosions, hit flashes, and collectible highlights.
- Drive particle animations via procedural sprite frames and remove them automatically when their lifetime ends.
- Submit batched draw calls through the rendering system to minimize state changes.

## Implementation Notes

- Effect templates live in data files so artists can iterate without editing executable code.
- Avoid embedding project names or scenario references in effect identifiers.
- Coordinate with the audio and gameplay event systems through lightweight notification hooks.
